    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Voice Agent Assistant: Calendar MCP Server\n*Talk to a Vapi voice agent → it manages your Google Calendar through these tools*\n\nThis workflow exposes 5 calendar tools over **MCP** (Model Context Protocol). A Vapi voice assistant connects to the MCP URL and calls the tools mid-conversation:\n- **Check Availability** · **Create Event** · **Get Events** · **Update Event** · **Delete Event**\n\nEach tool is a small sub-workflow. The agent fills the inputs itself via `$fromAI()`.\n\n## Setup\n1. Import the 5 files in `sub-workflows/` and connect Google Calendar\n2. In each `Call '…'` node here, select the matching sub-workflow\n3. Create a **Bearer Auth** credential for the MCP trigger and activate\n4. In Vapi, add an MCP tool pointing at the trigger's Production URL with the same bearer token",
        "height": 500,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1100,
        -160
      ],
      "id": "33b91e23-17e4-4a03-8ab4-e61cb2aa5fe2",
      "name": "Overview"
    }
